{{!
    @template report_competency/user_competency_summary

    The rating cell of the competency breakdown report, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors report_competency/user_competency_summary of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    report/competency/templates/user_competency_summary.mustache, a four-line template with no
    docblock. Re-diff it against that file on every core upgrade.

    Kept from core: one link, href "#", titled with the "User competency summary" string (Behat's
    "breakdown rating" selector finds the cell by that title, and the report's grading popup opens on
    a click anywhere in the cell); the rating's name double-stashed; the "Not rated" string when there
    is no rating, as the whole text of the link (core's Behat clicks the "Not rated" link).
    Changed: the rating is a pill with a star; beside it a second pill says, in words and with an
    icon, whether the rating is proficient, which core showed only as the green of the cell; not rated
    is a neutral pill of its own. Proficiency is read from the user_competency_course record's
    proficiency, as core's cell class was.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * grade - the rating's value, or null
    * gradename - the rating's name
    * proficiency - whether the rating is proficient

    Example context (json):
    {
        "grade": 2,
        "gradename": "Competent",
        "proficiency": true
    }
}}
<a href="#" class="dim-comp-pills" title="{{#str}}usercompetencysummary, report_competency{{/str}}">
    {{#grade}}
    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--rated">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-star dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{gradename}}
    </span>
    {{#proficiency}}
    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--proficient">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{#str}}proficient, tool_lp{{/str}}
    </span>
    {{/proficiency}}
    {{^proficiency}}
    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notproficient">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{#str}}competency_notproficient, theme_dimensions{{/str}}
    </span>
    {{/proficiency}}
    {{/grade}}
    {{^grade}}
    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notrated">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{#str}}notrated, report_competency{{/str}}
    </span>
    {{/grade}}
</a>
